{"categories":[{"id":1,"name":"Floral Designs"},{"id":2,"name":"Animal Patterns"},{"id":3,"name":"Holidays"},{"id":4,"name":"Monograms"},{"id":5,"name":"Cooking"},{"id":6,"name":"Celebrations"},{"id":7,"name":"Miscellaneous"},{"id":8,"name":"Floral & Monogram"},{"id":9,"name":"Characters"}],"products":[{"id":9,"title":"Paradise Bird","category_id":2,"price":"19.99","stitch_count":65910,"file_format":"PES","is_available":true,"physical_product":false,"shippable":false,"description":"<p>A magnificent tropical bird rendered in 38 thread colors, with sweeping plumage and vivid detail that makes this design a true showpiece. Stunning on pillow covers, tote bags, and tropical home décor. One of our most complex and rewarding designs to stitch.</p>"},{"id":10,"title":"Tiger","category_id":2,"price":"19.99","stitch_count":46174,"file_format":"PES","is_available":true,"physical_product":false,"shippable":false,"description":"<p>A bold, powerful tiger head with a commanding expression, worked in rich orange, black, and ivory tones. Perfect for sports gear, backpacks, and statement apparel. The strong contrast makes this design pop on both light and dark fabrics.</p>"},{"id":11,"title":"Larry the Laid-Back Frog","category_id":2,"price":"19.99","stitch_count":32514,"file_format":"PES","is_available":true,"physical_product":false,"shippable":false,"description":"<p>Everyone's favorite relaxed amphibian, kicking back with a big grin and an easy attitude. Bright, cheerful colors make this perfect for kids' tees, towels, and casual summer gear. Larry brings good vibes wherever he lands.</p>"},{"id":12,"title":"Flamingo Flo","category_id":2,"price":"19.99","stitch_count":20276,"file_format":"PES","is_available":true,"physical_product":false,"shippable":false,"description":"<p>An elegant flamingo in graceful profile, rendered in warm pinks and coral tones with delicate feather detail. A natural fit for beach bags, summer apparel, linen napkins, and resort-style décor. Sophisticated and effortlessly stylish.</p>"},{"id":13,"title":"Giraffe","category_id":2,"price":"19.99","stitch_count":20612,"file_format":"PES","is_available":true,"physical_product":false,"shippable":false,"description":"<p>A charming giraffe portrait with warm golden and amber tones and a gentle expression. Clean lines and a friendly feel make this ideal for nursery items, children's clothing, and safari-themed home accessories. A family favorite for all ages.</p>"},{"id":14,"title":"Pink Flower Fairy","category_id":1,"price":"19.99","stitch_count":21308,"file_format":"PES","is_available":true,"physical_product":false,"shippable":false,"description":"<p>A delicate fairy nestled among blooming flowers, worked in 47 thread colors with extraordinary detail. The richness of color and intricate stitching make this ideal for framed display pieces, special garments, and heirloom projects. A true labor of love with a magical result.</p>"},{"id":15,"title":"Decorative Frame Border","category_id":1,"price":"19.99","stitch_count":38777,"file_format":"PES","is_available":true,"physical_product":false,"shippable":false,"description":"<p>An ornate decorative border with flowing scrollwork and classical elegance. Versatile and refined — use it to frame monograms on towels, dress up pillowcases, or add a formal flourish to table linens. Pairs beautifully with any center design or text.</p>"},{"id":16,"title":"Mushroom Border","category_id":1,"price":"19.99","stitch_count":26953,"file_format":"PES","is_available":true,"physical_product":false,"shippable":false,"description":"<p>A whimsical woodland border featuring charming mushrooms with rich earth tones and playful detail. Perfect for kitchen towels, tote bags, aprons, and napkins. Brings a cozy, fairy-tale warmth to any everyday item.</p>"},{"id":17,"title":"Flower Monogram — A","category_id":4,"price":"19.99","stitch_count":4692,"file_format":"PES","is_available":true,"physical_product":false,"shippable":false,"description":"<p>A beautiful floral letter A surrounded by delicate botanical detail in soft, natural tones. Perfect for personalizing towels, tote bags, apparel, and keepsakes. Clean and elegant — a timeless monogram style that works on nearly any fabric.</p>"},{"id":18,"title":"Christmas Teddy Bear","category_id":3,"price":"19.99","stitch_count":53789,"file_format":"PES","is_available":true,"physical_product":false,"shippable":false,"description":"<p>A festive teddy bear dressed for the season, carrying gifts and wearing a warm holiday expression. Rich detail and classic Christmas colors make this a perennial favorite for stockings, holiday pillows, seasonal apparel, and gift bags. A must-stitch for the holiday collection.</p>"},{"id":19,"title":"Easter Eeyore","category_id":3,"price":"19.99","stitch_count":36792,"file_format":"PES","is_available":true,"physical_product":false,"shippable":false,"description":"<p>The loveable donkey dressed up for Easter in soft pastels and springtime cheer. A crowd-pleaser that works beautifully on kids' apparel, Easter baskets, seasonal tote bags, and holiday décor. Warm and familiar — sure to bring a smile.</p>"},{"id":20,"title":"Halloween Pumpkin Mouse","category_id":3,"price":"19.99","stitch_count":15402,"file_format":"PES","is_available":true,"physical_product":false,"shippable":false,"description":"<p>A spooky-cute little mouse in a carved pumpkin costume, ready for trick-or-treat. Worked in 27 thread colors with expressive detail. Perfect for Halloween tote bags, seasonal shirts, and festive home décor that's more cute than scary.</p>"},{"id":21,"title":"Snow Globe","category_id":3,"price":"19.99","stitch_count":15640,"file_format":"PES","is_available":true,"physical_product":false,"shippable":false,"description":"<p>A magical winter scene captured inside a shimmering snow globe, with delicate snowflakes and warm light. Elegant and timeless — works beautifully on holiday stockings, winter scarves, gift wrap, and seasonal home accents. A quiet, beautiful design for the winter season.</p>"},{"id":22,"title":"Pierrot the Clown","category_id":9,"price":"19.99","stitch_count":31186,"file_format":"PES","is_available":true,"physical_product":false,"shippable":false,"description":"<p>A classic Pierrot clown in full theatrical costume — the melancholy romantic of the commedia dell'arte tradition. Worked in 18 colors with expressive detail, this is a sophisticated character piece that looks stunning framed, on a statement garment, or as a display cushion. Unique and unforgettable.</p>"},{"id":23,"title":"Granny Embroidering","category_id":9,"price":"19.99","stitch_count":33437,"file_format":"PES","is_available":true,"physical_product":false,"shippable":false,"description":"<p>A charming cartoon grandmother bent over her embroidery hoop, stitching away with joyful concentration. The perfect gift for any embroidery enthusiast — a warm, funny, and deeply relatable design. Works on tote bags, aprons, tea towels, and anywhere a crafter might keep their supplies.</p>"},{"id":24,"title":"Rhinestone Cowgirl","category_id":9,"price":"19.99","stitch_count":32202,"file_format":"PES","is_available":true,"physical_product":false,"shippable":false,"description":"<p>A sassy, confident cowgirl with big personality and western flair. Bold lines and vibrant colors make this design pop on denim jackets, tote bags, country-style apparel, and accessories. She's got attitude to spare — and the stitching to match.</p>"},{"id":25,"title":"Clown in Spotlight","category_id":9,"price":"19.99","stitch_count":37402,"file_format":"PES","is_available":true,"physical_product":false,"shippable":false,"description":"<p>A larger-than-life clown character with oversized features and vibrant circus colors, designed for maximum impact on big hoop sizes. Playful and eye-catching — great for kids' rooms, carnival-themed décor, and statement pieces that demand attention.</p>"},{"id":26,"title":"Chef with Pasta","category_id":9,"price":"19.99","stitch_count":24096,"file_format":"PES","is_available":true,"physical_product":false,"shippable":false,"description":"<p>A jolly chef mid-toss with a steaming plate of pasta, full of warmth and appetite. A natural for kitchen towels, aprons, oven mitts, and food-lover gifts. Rich earth tones and expressive linework make this one of the most cheerful kitchen designs in our collection.</p>"},{"id":27,"title":"Art Nouveau Aria","category_id":7,"price":"19.99","stitch_count":56335,"file_format":"PES","is_available":true,"physical_product":false,"shippable":false,"description":"<p>An Art Nouveau-inspired figure in flowing organic lines and rich jewel tones — 23 thread colors woven into a design that feels like wearable fine art. Ideal as a framed embroidery display, on an heirloom cushion, or as a statement piece on formal garments. One of our most striking and technically demanding designs.</p>"},{"id":28,"title":"Wine Bottle","category_id":7,"price":"19.99","stitch_count":48807,"file_format":"PES","is_available":true,"physical_product":false,"shippable":false,"description":"<p>An elegant wine bottle rendered in 30 thread colors with rich, deep tones and fine label detail. Perfect for kitchen décor, wine-themed gifts, linen bags, and entertaining accessories. Sophisticated without being fussy — the kind of design that looks right at home in any well-appointed kitchen.</p>"}],"blobs":[{"id":413,"key":"90x80fp97bfb4hdpeax1vbvjhgpl","filename":"Paradijs Vogel Lg.pes","content_type":"application/octet-stream","byte_size":415137,"checksum":"BTDOuZCAV/b4+KKgAcJ4tw==","service_name":"amazon","created_at":"2026-07-08T07:15:42Z"},{"id":414,"key":"0vqdz0kg32q04ns8uzzoxxr255m0","filename":"paradise-bird-dark.png","content_type":"image/png","byte_size":556870,"checksum":"6DUUWWSjC+CTwmQfJ2/l9A==","service_name":"amazon","created_at":"2026-07-08T07:15:45Z"},{"id":415,"key":"dwtqdab6dolxj73l4gqxbjpjbsgw","filename":"paradise-bird-light.png","content_type":"image/png","byte_size":527979,"checksum":"Bn